      <p style="margin-top: 16px;">Beyond origin, price is shaped by colour depth and saturation, treatment status (untreated stones command a premium), clarity, cut quality, and size. As always: a smaller stone with commanding colour and natural stability will outperform a larger, dull one.</p>
